      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "LTX-AV MUSIC (audio_conditioned_video) mini -- CURRENT recipe from eng_ltx_av.py (LtxAvMusicEngine, _is_talk=False), for A/B vs the talk mini and the video mini.\n\nPRE-BAKED ASSETS (non-generative): LoadAudio=vz_bill_boerst.wav (indextts2 CC0 voice ref; any speech/music .wav in ComfyUI/input works). NO init image -- the music lane is audio-reactive scene motion (sync-loose), not lip-sync, so it uses EmptyLTXVLatentVideo instead of LoadImage -> LTXVImgToVideo.\n\nDIFF vs the TALK mini:\n(a) NO LoadImage / NO LTXVImgToVideo.\n(b) EmptyLTXVLatentVideo supplies the video latent into LTXVConcatAVLatent.\n(c) CFGGuider reads the LTXVConditioning positive/negative DIRECTLY (talk routes them through the I2V node's conditioning outputs).\n(d) fallback engine = ltx_video (talk -> humo).\n\nSHARED LTX-AV recipe: Q3_K_M GGUF unet; NO distilled LoRA; ModelSamplingLTXV 2.05/0.95; audio path LoadAudio -> LTXVAudioVAEEncode(audio VAE) -> LTXVConcatAVLatent, split at LTXVSeparateAVLatent (audio latent DROPPED, V-1 silent); KSamplerSelect=euler; LTXVScheduler steps=8; CFG=3.0; Gemma device=cpu; VAEDecodeTiled temporal_size=64. Canvas 832x480x105; if VRAM exceeds 14.5GB on a 16GB board, drop EmptyLTXVLatentVideo width/height to 512x288 (OTR_LTX_AV_RENDER_CANVAS)."
      ]
    }
